1
00:01:35,960 --> 00:01:40,110
[River of No Return]

2
00:01:40,130 --> 00:01:42,970
[Episode 3: Iron Alliance]

3
00:01:45,420 --> 00:01:46,229
Will you talk?

4
00:01:47,729 --> 00:01:48,930
I'll talk. I'll talk.

5
00:01:49,039 --> 00:01:49,900
I'm from the Iron Alliance.

6
00:01:49,900 --> 00:01:50,460
What?

7
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:51,740
The Iron Alliance?

8
00:01:52,020 --> 00:01:53,740
You're from the Iron Alliance?

9
00:01:53,740 --> 00:01:55,890
Why were you outside Lord Guo's house?

10
00:01:56,759 --> 00:01:57,870
Do you know

11
00:01:58,340 --> 00:01:59,340
how Lord Guo died?

12
00:02:00,730 --> 00:02:02,820
The envoy only told me

13
00:02:02,930 --> 00:02:04,990
to watch the body being carried away.

14
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:06,090
So,

15
00:02:06,940 --> 00:02:09,539
your Iron Alliance
had Lord Guo killed, right?

16
00:02:10,070 --> 00:02:11,800
I really don't know about that.

17
00:02:11,820 --> 00:02:12,650
You don't know this,

18
00:02:12,650 --> 00:02:13,980
and you don't know that.

19
00:02:14,380 --> 00:02:15,470
Do you know anything at all?

20
00:02:15,470 --> 00:02:16,750
The Iron Alliance will gather

21
00:02:16,750 --> 00:02:18,160
at Xinghua Restaurant today
at the You hour.

22
00:02:18,160 --> 00:02:19,700
I've told you everything I know.

23
00:02:19,700 --> 00:02:21,320
My lord, please be merciful.

24
00:02:21,340 --> 00:02:22,520
Spare me, my lord.

25
00:02:22,829 --> 00:02:25,490
♪ I brave the wind, I hit the ground ♪

26
00:02:25,520 --> 00:02:27,410
♪ I take the blows head-on,
never crying out in pain ♪

27
00:02:25,829 --> 00:02:27,350
[Yingtian Prefecture]

28
00:02:28,290 --> 00:02:31,070
♪ My life hangs by a thread,
my worries buried in my bones ♪

29
00:02:31,290 --> 00:02:33,180
♪ Whatever I owe, I'll repay in time ♪

30
00:02:34,690 --> 00:02:35,490
Uncle Laoliu.

31
00:02:35,630 --> 00:02:36,810
Have you seen my father?

32
00:02:36,810 --> 00:02:37,310
No.

33
00:02:37,860 --> 00:02:39,160
I haven't seen him all day.

34
00:02:39,160 --> 00:02:40,020
He didn't come?

35
00:02:40,540 --> 00:02:42,820
I just sent him to the main hall.

36
00:02:43,970 --> 00:02:45,829
It's best if he doesn't come back.

37
00:02:46,950 --> 00:02:47,950
If you see him,

38
00:02:48,760 --> 00:02:49,960
don't bring him here.

39
00:02:50,570 --> 00:02:51,790
Hey, Uncle Laoliu,

40
00:02:52,190 --> 00:02:54,260
don't beat around the bush. Just say it.

41
00:02:54,260 --> 00:02:55,720
Didn't you see it that day?

42
00:02:57,310 --> 00:02:58,380
The Censor Guo Zhimin

43
00:02:58,380 --> 00:03:00,510
didn't die
from the earthquake at all.

44
00:03:00,640 --> 00:03:04,300
Didn't you think about why your father
closed the case so hastily?

45
00:03:05,540 --> 00:03:06,810
After the Crown Prince's treasure ship
blew up,

46
00:03:06,810 --> 00:03:08,250
the earlier Huliu explosive case

47
00:03:08,250 --> 00:03:10,250
is not as simple as it seemed, right?

48
00:03:11,300 --> 00:03:12,360
They are all saying

49
00:03:12,510 --> 00:03:15,110
that your father has ties
to the Iron Alliance.

50
00:03:16,700 --> 00:03:17,540
Who spread it?

51
00:03:17,990 --> 00:03:18,500
Who is it?

52
00:03:18,500 --> 00:03:19,140
-Who?
-Stop shouting.

53
00:03:19,140 --> 00:03:20,260
-Did you spread it?
-Stop shouting.

54
00:03:20,260 --> 00:03:20,950
Go, go, go.

55
00:03:21,020 --> 00:03:22,470
-No. Go, go, go.
-Did you two spread it?

56
00:03:22,470 --> 00:03:22,790
Go.

57
00:03:22,790 --> 00:03:24,280
-Hurry.
-Let me see who's running their mouth!

58
00:03:24,280 --> 00:03:24,790
Who?

59
00:03:25,750 --> 00:03:26,350
Go, go, go.

60
00:03:26,630 --> 00:03:27,829
I never saw you today.

61
00:03:27,980 --> 00:03:28,770
Stop. Enough.

62
00:03:28,770 --> 00:03:30,190
If you spread rumors again,

63
00:03:30,190 --> 00:03:31,150
I'll kill you!

64
00:03:32,350 --> 00:03:33,190
Seriously.

65
00:03:42,079 --> 00:03:43,820
You know you saved
the Crown Prince, right?

66
00:03:43,820 --> 00:03:45,310
What are you talking about out of nowhere?

67
00:03:45,310 --> 00:03:46,510
You definitely know.

68
00:03:47,700 --> 00:03:49,230
I'm just a lowly constable.

69
00:03:49,640 --> 00:03:51,700
How could I run into the Crown Prince?

70
00:03:52,579 --> 00:03:53,820
Why brings you here?

71
00:03:54,540 --> 00:03:55,400
I asked around.

72
00:03:57,310 --> 00:03:58,980
Before the treasure ship exploded
and sank,

73
00:03:58,980 --> 00:04:00,290
you and your father
were already investigating

74
00:04:00,290 --> 00:04:01,210
the Huliu explosive case,

75
00:04:01,210 --> 00:04:01,810
right?

76
00:04:06,130 --> 00:04:07,170
What else did you find out?

77
00:04:07,170 --> 00:04:08,710
You have an unmarried younger sister.

78
00:04:08,710 --> 00:04:09,690
Little Xingren.

79
00:04:10,280 --> 00:04:11,750
You can ask around.

80
00:04:12,080 --> 00:04:13,300
But I'm warning you.

81
00:04:13,580 --> 00:04:15,580
Don't get any ideas about my family.

82
00:04:18,140 --> 00:04:19,370
Your father has a lover

83
00:04:19,370 --> 00:04:20,490
in the Fule Brothel.

84
00:04:20,490 --> 00:04:21,820
So what?

85
00:04:22,900 --> 00:04:23,750
Besides,

86
00:04:23,840 --> 00:04:24,900
is the Fule Brothel

87
00:04:24,960 --> 00:04:26,610
a place for an official like you

88
00:04:26,610 --> 00:04:27,550
to go?

89
00:04:27,580 --> 00:04:28,950
Can you afford it?

90
00:04:29,310 --> 00:04:30,840
What are you talking about?

91
00:04:30,850 --> 00:04:31,940
Let me remind you.

92
00:04:33,320 --> 00:04:34,800
Given how you've treated the Crown Prince,

93
00:04:34,800 --> 00:04:37,550
you could already be charged
with Great Disrespect.

94
00:04:37,550 --> 00:04:38,810
According to the laws of Ming,

95
00:04:38,810 --> 00:04:39,820
anyone who commits
Great Disrespect

96
00:04:39,820 --> 00:04:40,960
is treated as treason.

97
00:04:40,960 --> 00:04:43,020
All men in the family, regardless
of severe illness or disability,

98
00:04:43,020 --> 00:04:43,970
will be beheaded.

99
00:04:43,970 --> 00:04:45,040
Their mothers, daughters, wives,
concubines, and sisters

100
00:04:45,040 --> 00:04:46,810
will be given to the families
of meritorious officials as slaves.

101
00:04:46,810 --> 00:04:47,580
Got it?

102
00:04:49,280 --> 00:04:50,100
I see.

103
00:04:50,690 --> 00:04:51,630
You need my help.

104
00:04:55,320 --> 00:04:57,890
If you need help, just say so.

105
00:04:58,280 --> 00:05:01,140
What's the point
of beating around the bush so much?

106
00:05:01,580 --> 00:05:02,140
Speak.

107
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:03,820
What does His Highness the Crown Prince

108
00:05:03,820 --> 00:05:04,820
want me to do?

109
00:05:06,160 --> 00:05:08,090
How much are you planning to pay me?

110
00:05:08,310 --> 00:05:10,640
That Good-for-Nothing just loves money.

111
00:05:10,820 --> 00:05:12,700
Just give him whatever he wants.

112
00:05:18,320 --> 00:05:19,460
His Highness was right.

113
00:05:19,460 --> 00:05:20,690
You only have eyes for money.

114
00:05:20,690 --> 00:05:21,240
Yes.

115
00:05:22,270 --> 00:05:23,600
I only care about money.

116
00:05:29,020 --> 00:05:30,150
Good-for-Nothing.

117
00:05:34,630 --> 00:05:35,950
Steamed buns!

118
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:37,710
[Xinghua Restaurant]

119
00:05:36,120 --> 00:05:38,020
Freshly steamed buns!

120
00:05:43,010 --> 00:05:44,270
I'm sorry, sir.

121
00:05:47,400 --> 00:05:48,530
Please bear with us.

122
00:05:50,840 --> 00:05:51,840
How can you be sure

123
00:05:51,870 --> 00:05:53,930
this is the Iron Alliance's hideout?

124
00:05:59,110 --> 00:06:01,310
Three hundred taels of 80% pure silver,

125
00:06:01,580 --> 00:06:02,780
paid in full upfront.

126
00:06:05,930 --> 00:06:06,570
Can I...

127
00:06:06,590 --> 00:06:08,380
You work for the Crown Prince,

128
00:06:08,900 --> 00:06:10,630
and you can't afford 300 taels?

129
00:06:11,260 --> 00:06:12,310
Not a penny less.

130
00:06:13,200 --> 00:06:15,460
I mean, can I pay you
after the job's done?

131
00:06:16,110 --> 00:06:17,570
Do you even know the rules?

132
00:06:17,780 --> 00:06:18,550
No.

133
00:06:19,020 --> 00:06:19,840
At a time like this,

134
00:06:19,840 --> 00:06:21,720
where am I supposed
to get that much silver for you?

135
00:06:21,720 --> 00:06:22,600
That's your problem.

136
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:23,610
What does it have to do with me?

137
00:06:23,610 --> 00:06:24,940
Figure it out yourself.

138
00:06:26,790 --> 00:06:29,190
You're taking advantage of the situation.

139
00:06:29,640 --> 00:06:30,550
Listen.

140
00:06:30,940 --> 00:06:32,800
Divide the silver into two parts.

141
00:06:33,050 --> 00:06:34,380
Send one part to

142
00:06:34,820 --> 00:06:35,950
the fifth house on Zhongxiang Lane

143
00:06:35,950 --> 00:06:37,930
in Tangfanglang,
northwest of Zhenhuai Bridge.

144
00:06:37,930 --> 00:06:39,930
Give it to my little sister, Wu Yulu.

145
00:06:39,930 --> 00:06:40,990
Send the other part

146
00:06:40,990 --> 00:06:43,010
to the third lane, eighth courtyard,
Fule Brothel, Wuning Bridge.

147
00:06:43,010 --> 00:06:43,970
Give it to Granny Tong.

148
00:06:43,970 --> 00:06:44,570
Got it?

149
00:06:44,570 --> 00:06:45,370
Fule Brothel?

150
00:06:47,220 --> 00:06:48,820
You want me to send the silver

151
00:06:49,340 --> 00:06:50,380
to a brothel?

152
00:06:51,190 --> 00:06:53,120
What's it to you what place this is?

153
00:06:53,540 --> 00:06:54,930
It's my silver.

154
00:06:55,200 --> 00:06:57,180
I can send it wherever I want.

155
00:06:58,130 --> 00:06:59,590
Is it any of your business?

156
00:07:04,750 --> 00:07:05,580
Fine.

157
00:07:08,870 --> 00:07:10,270
With 300 taels of silver,

158
00:07:10,700 --> 00:07:11,630
what can I get?

159
00:07:13,630 --> 00:07:14,140
Here.

160
00:07:16,310 --> 00:07:17,140
Look.

161
00:07:18,190 --> 00:07:19,190
These people

162
00:07:19,930 --> 00:07:21,330
are clearing the streets

163
00:07:21,630 --> 00:07:24,430
and frequently going in
and out of the restaurant.

164
00:07:25,170 --> 00:07:28,080
They're either gathering people
or up to something.

165
00:07:28,080 --> 00:07:29,630
Sir, I'm really sorry.

166
00:07:29,650 --> 00:07:30,910
How about you close up early today?

167
00:07:30,910 --> 00:07:32,170
Here, take the silver.

168
00:07:32,880 --> 00:07:33,990
I'm really sorry.

169
00:07:37,390 --> 00:07:39,190
Why are you still standing here?

170
00:07:39,320 --> 00:07:40,320
Hurry back to the palace,

171
00:07:40,320 --> 00:07:41,570
report to the Crown Prince,

172
00:07:41,570 --> 00:07:42,970
and ask him for the money.

173
00:07:43,140 --> 00:07:44,200
After this is done,

174
00:07:44,510 --> 00:07:47,570
you and your father
will have rendered a great service.

175
00:07:49,220 --> 00:07:49,950
Stay here.

176
00:07:50,280 --> 00:07:51,460
Don't leave even for a step.

177
00:07:51,460 --> 00:07:52,520
Do you understand?

178
00:07:52,780 --> 00:07:54,020
Don't worry. Go.

179
00:07:54,100 --> 00:07:55,020
When I do things,

180
00:07:55,020 --> 00:07:56,220
you can rest assured.

181
00:08:21,550 --> 00:08:22,610
Greetings, Envoy.

182
00:09:01,270 --> 00:09:03,460
Waiter, two more jars of good wine!

183
00:09:03,790 --> 00:09:05,790
Okay, okay, okay. Wait, wait, wait.

184
00:09:06,550 --> 00:09:09,280
Food for Chunxiang Pavilion
on the second floor!

185
00:09:17,830 --> 00:09:19,260
If we are on the same side,

186
00:09:20,670 --> 00:09:22,080
Yulu is my sister.

187
00:09:22,980 --> 00:09:25,910
I was never part of your Iron Alliance.

188
00:09:26,080 --> 00:09:29,080
And I definitely don't want
to be involved with you now.

189
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:29,620
Do it.

190
00:10:00,070 --> 00:10:02,100
Is the son you brought to Jinling

191
00:10:03,450 --> 00:10:05,110
the person we are looking for?

192
00:10:07,500 --> 00:10:09,190
Please.

193
00:10:09,790 --> 00:10:11,550
I really don't want to get involved

194
00:10:11,550 --> 00:10:13,610
in the Iron Alliance's mess anymore.

195
00:10:14,070 --> 00:10:15,930
Please let my son and daughter go.

196
00:10:16,390 --> 00:10:17,620
I just want them

197
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:19,670
to live a normal life.

198
00:10:22,310 --> 00:10:23,460
A normal life?

199
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:26,030
Do you know how the others

200
00:10:26,030 --> 00:10:27,490
have lived all these years?

201
00:10:27,490 --> 00:10:28,750
The court has been hunting us down.

202
00:10:28,750 --> 00:10:30,230
Some of our people have grown old;
others are dead.

203
00:10:30,230 --> 00:10:31,700
You think you can just say, "I was never one
of you, and I want nothing to do with you,"

204
00:10:31,700 --> 00:10:33,100
and wash your hands of it?

205
00:10:34,840 --> 00:10:36,050
Looks like I'll have to use a little force

206
00:10:36,050 --> 00:10:37,960
to get you, Iron Lion, to talk.

207
00:10:40,690 --> 00:10:42,020
What are you going to do?

208
00:10:42,430 --> 00:10:44,560
The person you are looking for is dead!

209
00:10:45,460 --> 00:10:47,100
Do you think you can fool me
by saying he's dead?

210
00:10:47,100 --> 00:10:47,630
Beat him!

211
00:10:48,430 --> 00:10:49,490
He died of illness!

212
00:10:50,340 --> 00:10:51,220
Get down!

213
00:10:55,190 --> 00:10:57,270
If you want to live, get out of here!

214
00:11:22,120 --> 00:11:23,450
Did you see Wu Dingyuan?

215
00:11:23,500 --> 00:11:24,230
Wu Dingyuan?

216
00:11:24,960 --> 00:11:26,020
Who is Wu Dingyuan?

217
00:11:26,070 --> 00:11:27,000
I don't know him.

218
00:11:29,910 --> 00:11:31,240
This Good-for-Nothing

219
00:11:31,620 --> 00:11:32,880
doesn't keep his word.

220
00:11:45,660 --> 00:11:46,870
Seize them all!

221
00:11:49,340 --> 00:11:51,100
Don't let any of them escape!

222
00:11:51,290 --> 00:11:51,950
Don't move!

223
00:11:52,220 --> 00:11:52,790
Stop!

224
00:11:53,390 --> 00:11:53,990
Don't run!

225
00:12:41,150 --> 00:12:42,500
♪ Along the Qinhuai River in Nanjing ♪

226
00:12:42,540 --> 00:12:44,040
♪ I patrol the streets,
swaying along day after day ♪

227
00:12:44,100 --> 00:12:45,970
♪ A jug of wine in hand,
a blade of grass between my teeth ♪

228
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:47,370
♪ Even the rowdiest ghosts run
when they see me ♪

229
00:12:47,400 --> 00:12:48,900
♪ Through storms and flames, I press on ♪

230
00:12:48,930 --> 00:12:50,660
♪ I drag my life along like a rope ♪

231
00:12:50,680 --> 00:12:52,240
♪ They call me a young constable ♪

232
00:12:52,260 --> 00:12:54,000
♪ But this realm isn't mine to rule ♪

233
00:12:54,020 --> 00:12:55,550
♪ Isn't mine to rule ♪

234
00:13:13,860 --> 00:13:15,100
Quick, after them!

235
00:13:15,550 --> 00:13:17,950
Round up every last one
of those fugitives!

236
00:14:11,220 --> 00:14:12,070
Still eating?

237
00:14:14,550 --> 00:14:15,620
Put the bowl down.

238
00:14:22,250 --> 00:14:23,040
You...

239
00:14:23,670 --> 00:14:24,670
You little brat.

240
00:14:24,960 --> 00:14:25,690
Take it away.

241
00:14:26,200 --> 00:14:27,030
Why should I?

242
00:14:27,410 --> 00:14:28,340
You are my son.

243
00:14:28,480 --> 00:14:29,480
Are you my father?

244
00:14:29,480 --> 00:14:30,190
Whether I'm your father or not,

245
00:14:30,190 --> 00:14:31,450
you can't point this thing at me.

246
00:14:31,450 --> 00:14:31,870
Take it away.

247
00:14:31,870 --> 00:14:33,000
Whether I'm your son or not,

248
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:34,330
you shouldn't lie to me!

249
00:14:34,740 --> 00:14:36,360
Shouldn't you be
at the prefectural office?

250
00:14:36,360 --> 00:14:38,030
What were you doing at Xinghua Restaurant?

251
00:14:38,030 --> 00:14:38,550
Talk!

252
00:14:38,830 --> 00:14:41,120
I don't have time to talk nonsense
with you right now.

253
00:14:41,120 --> 00:14:43,050
Go as far away
as possible right now.

254
00:14:43,050 --> 00:14:44,620
Wait for me at Zhengyang Gate tomorrow.

255
00:14:44,620 --> 00:14:45,700
Zhengyang Gate?

256
00:14:45,720 --> 00:14:47,310
Why would I go to Zhengyang Gate?

257
00:14:47,310 --> 00:14:49,240
-Stand still!
-What are you doing?

258
00:14:49,330 --> 00:14:49,890
Talk!

259
00:14:54,530 --> 00:14:55,100
Father.

260
00:14:56,620 --> 00:14:58,150
You must tell me today.

261
00:14:58,590 --> 00:15:01,360
What is your relationship
with the Iron Alliance?

262
00:15:01,360 --> 00:15:02,910
Why did you kneel to that little girl

263
00:15:02,910 --> 00:15:04,670
at Xinghua Restaurant?

264
00:15:04,700 --> 00:15:05,790
Why?

265
00:15:07,310 --> 00:15:08,570
Why did Lord Guo Zhimin

266
00:15:08,740 --> 00:15:09,580
die?

267
00:15:10,580 --> 00:15:12,000
The Sanshan Street explosion,

268
00:15:12,000 --> 00:15:13,080
the treasure ship bombing—

269
00:15:13,080 --> 00:15:14,140
you've played dumb

270
00:15:14,430 --> 00:15:16,160
about every one of these cases.

271
00:15:16,270 --> 00:15:16,860
Father.

272
00:15:17,270 --> 00:15:18,430
Tell me the truth.

273
00:15:18,670 --> 00:15:20,910
Are you in some kind of trouble?

274
00:15:21,480 --> 00:15:22,950
Listen to me.

275
00:15:23,200 --> 00:15:24,930
Stay as far away from those people
at Xinghua Restaurant as possible.

276
00:15:24,930 --> 00:15:26,360
The rest has nothing to do with you.

277
00:15:26,360 --> 00:15:27,720
Then what does it have to do with me?

278
00:15:27,720 --> 00:15:28,780
Stand right there!

279
00:15:30,050 --> 00:15:32,150
I can't tell what's true and what's a lie

280
00:15:32,150 --> 00:15:33,480
when you speak anymore.

281
00:15:33,930 --> 00:15:36,130
You must explain it to me clearly today.

282
00:15:36,530 --> 00:15:37,990
Are you interrogating me?

283
00:15:38,320 --> 00:15:39,500
So what if I am?

284
00:15:39,960 --> 00:15:40,600
I am interrogating you.

285
00:15:40,600 --> 00:15:41,820
And you're poking me with that?

286
00:15:41,820 --> 00:15:42,500
I am.

287
00:15:42,740 --> 00:15:44,060
Come on, poke me through.

288
00:15:44,060 --> 00:15:44,680
Poke me through.

289
00:15:44,680 --> 00:15:46,230
Come on, stab me!

290
00:15:54,980 --> 00:15:55,530
Father.

291
00:15:56,980 --> 00:15:58,700
Can you just listen to me?

292
00:16:00,020 --> 00:16:01,620
The Crown Prince is not dead.

293
00:16:02,030 --> 00:16:03,390
I saved him.

294
00:16:04,980 --> 00:16:06,240
Wait, what did you say?

295
00:16:07,500 --> 00:16:09,560
Did you really save the Crown Prince?

296
00:16:09,650 --> 00:16:10,620
Yes.

297
00:16:11,860 --> 00:16:13,100
He owes me a favor.

298
00:16:13,390 --> 00:16:14,190
Well, Father.

299
00:16:14,270 --> 00:16:14,700
Hey.

300
00:16:15,390 --> 00:16:16,720
If you have any trouble,

301
00:16:16,770 --> 00:16:18,070
I'll have him take care of it for you.

302
00:16:18,070 --> 00:16:19,100
But you have

303
00:16:19,100 --> 00:16:20,430
to tell me.

304
00:16:26,620 --> 00:16:27,190
You...

305
00:16:28,580 --> 00:16:30,410
You can't be involved
in this case anymore.

306
00:16:30,410 --> 00:16:31,940
The people involved in this

307
00:16:32,170 --> 00:16:32,890
are all people...

308
00:16:32,890 --> 00:16:35,090
are all people we can't afford to cross.

309
00:16:35,170 --> 00:16:36,050
L-Listen to me.

310
00:16:36,050 --> 00:16:37,460
Don't get involved in this anymore.

311
00:16:37,460 --> 00:16:38,190
-I…
-Go away.

312
00:16:38,190 --> 00:16:39,580
Didn't I tell you—

313
00:16:39,820 --> 00:16:40,910
Don't follow me!

314
00:16:42,700 --> 00:16:43,550
Don't go home.

315
00:16:58,580 --> 00:16:59,790
Envoy. Envoy.

316
00:16:59,980 --> 00:17:01,040
It's his carriage.

317
00:17:38,230 --> 00:17:39,090
You go that way.

318
00:17:45,330 --> 00:17:46,130
Run.

319
00:17:47,040 --> 00:17:47,980
Keep running.

320
00:18:06,770 --> 00:18:08,570
You can't escape, Zhong Eryong.

321
00:19:51,890 --> 00:19:52,750
Your Highness.

322
00:19:53,520 --> 00:19:55,720
There is something I don't understand.

323
00:19:55,830 --> 00:19:58,200
Since the Huliu explosive

324
00:19:58,560 --> 00:19:59,990
was stolen from the palace,

325
00:19:59,990 --> 00:20:01,060
why not send Eunuch Zhu

326
00:20:01,060 --> 00:20:03,790
to conduct a strict investigation
in the palace?

327
00:20:05,560 --> 00:20:07,020
In the secondary capital,

328
00:20:07,700 --> 00:20:08,900
no one can be trusted.

329
00:20:10,980 --> 00:20:12,130
If that's the case,

330
00:20:12,500 --> 00:20:13,740
why does Your Highness

331
00:20:13,740 --> 00:20:15,470
insist on entering the palace?

332
00:20:16,300 --> 00:20:17,850
You're isolated and
without allies in the palace,

333
00:20:17,850 --> 00:20:19,650
leaving you in grave danger.

334
00:20:44,570 --> 00:20:45,790
Nothing ventured,

335
00:20:47,090 --> 00:20:48,690
nothing gained.

336
00:20:49,690 --> 00:20:50,550
Your Highness.

337
00:20:50,670 --> 00:20:51,760
Zhu Buhua is here.

338
00:21:59,670 --> 00:22:00,960
Your servant Zhu Buhua

339
00:22:01,190 --> 00:22:02,990
pays respects to Your Highness.

340
00:22:04,260 --> 00:22:06,590
As the eunuch commander
of the Brave Warriors Camp,

341
00:22:06,590 --> 00:22:08,260
when Your Highness was in danger,

342
00:22:08,260 --> 00:22:10,590
I failed to fulfill my duty
to protect you.

343
00:22:10,690 --> 00:22:12,170
That's in the past.

344
00:22:12,460 --> 00:22:14,260
Why do you keep talking about it?

345
00:22:14,890 --> 00:22:16,550
Rest assured, Your Highness.

346
00:22:16,800 --> 00:22:18,260
The danger you faced today

347
00:22:18,590 --> 00:22:19,850
will not happen again.

348
00:22:20,060 --> 00:22:21,500
I have ordered the Brave Warriors Camp

349
00:22:21,500 --> 00:22:22,630
to patrol strictly.

350
00:22:23,410 --> 00:22:25,170
We dare not slack off.

351
00:22:25,630 --> 00:22:28,090
You've only been in Jinling
for a few months.

352
00:22:28,260 --> 00:22:29,980
You are unfamiliar
with the people and the place,

353
00:22:29,980 --> 00:22:32,240
and you only have a few hundred soldiers.

354
00:22:33,080 --> 00:22:35,340
Just guarding the Imperial City alone

355
00:22:35,740 --> 00:22:37,800
is probably more than you can handle.

356
00:22:37,800 --> 00:22:38,560
Get up.

357
00:22:39,080 --> 00:22:40,080
I don't blame you.

358
00:22:45,770 --> 00:22:46,440
Come here.

359
00:23:01,470 --> 00:23:02,410
Let me ask you.

360
00:23:08,040 --> 00:23:11,500
The Huliu explosive that blew up the ship
came from the palace.

361
00:23:13,540 --> 00:23:15,090
The ones who want me dead

362
00:23:16,090 --> 00:23:18,220
are not just the Iron Alliance, right?

363
00:23:19,590 --> 00:23:20,130
This...

364
00:23:22,370 --> 00:23:23,970
Who do you think in this world

365
00:23:25,190 --> 00:23:26,960
wants me dead

366
00:23:28,200 --> 00:23:29,280
the most?

367
00:23:32,220 --> 00:23:33,080
Your Highness,

368
00:23:33,430 --> 00:23:35,430
I really dare not make wild guesses.

369
00:23:35,520 --> 00:23:36,760
If Your Highness gives the order,

370
00:23:36,760 --> 00:23:38,630
I will definitely have

371
00:23:38,630 --> 00:23:40,910
all the living officials
in Jinling arrested

372
00:23:40,910 --> 00:23:42,710
and interrogate them one by one.

373
00:23:46,170 --> 00:23:47,030
Your Highness.

374
00:23:47,370 --> 00:23:48,900
I have one more thing to say,

375
00:23:49,060 --> 00:23:50,470
but I'm not sure if I should.

376
00:23:50,470 --> 00:23:52,170
Aren't you already saying it?

377
00:23:53,960 --> 00:23:55,670
After I found out that the Huliu explosive

378
00:23:55,670 --> 00:23:56,870
was stolen from the palace,

379
00:23:56,870 --> 00:23:59,500
I immediately sent Wu Buping,
the chief constable of Yingtian Prefecture,

380
00:23:59,500 --> 00:24:00,900
to investigate the case.

381
00:24:01,180 --> 00:24:04,630
But I don't know why Lord Zheng ordered me

382
00:24:04,850 --> 00:24:06,540
to move all the remaining Huliu explosives

383
00:24:06,540 --> 00:24:07,880
out of the palace.

384
00:24:10,330 --> 00:24:11,730
From what you're saying,

385
00:24:12,540 --> 00:24:14,470
do you think there's anything else

386
00:24:14,520 --> 00:24:16,250
suspicious about this matter?

387
00:24:19,430 --> 00:24:20,290
Your Highness.

388
00:24:20,450 --> 00:24:21,930
I'm not smart enough.

389
00:24:22,110 --> 00:24:24,510
T-There are some things
I can't figure out.

390
00:24:25,430 --> 00:24:27,610
I'm just telling you exactly

391
00:24:28,130 --> 00:24:29,850
what I saw and heard,

392
00:24:29,980 --> 00:24:31,000
Your Highness.

393
00:24:40,160 --> 00:24:41,760
What's wrong with your face?

394
00:24:53,170 --> 00:24:54,030
Your Highness.

395
00:24:54,480 --> 00:24:55,200
I...

396
00:24:55,560 --> 00:24:57,620
I'm just not used to the climate here.

397
00:24:57,690 --> 00:24:58,930
I'm used to the north.

398
00:24:59,260 --> 00:25:01,280
Jinling is hot and humid.

399
00:25:01,760 --> 00:25:03,410
I can't eat or sleep well.

400
00:25:03,670 --> 00:25:05,200
It's really hard to endure.

401
00:25:10,700 --> 00:25:11,720
I see.

402
00:25:16,190 --> 00:25:18,650
A person's skin is like a paper lantern.

403
00:25:19,350 --> 00:25:20,880
Trouble comes from within.

404
00:25:21,590 --> 00:25:22,720
If it burns through,

405
00:25:23,680 --> 00:25:25,210
it will be hard to deal with.

406
00:25:29,460 --> 00:25:30,410
Zhu Buhua.

407
00:25:31,890 --> 00:25:33,480
You're the only one

408
00:25:34,800 --> 00:25:35,960
I can rely on here

409
00:25:36,200 --> 00:25:37,520
now.

410
00:26:05,610 --> 00:26:07,540
We must strengthen patrols today.

411
00:26:07,930 --> 00:26:09,060
Pass down the order.

412
00:26:09,520 --> 00:26:10,930
Anyone suspicious

413
00:26:11,350 --> 00:26:12,950
is to be killed immediately.

414
00:26:13,390 --> 00:26:14,000
Yes.

415
00:26:15,190 --> 00:26:16,280
Rotate the guards

416
00:26:17,110 --> 00:26:18,240
every four hours.

417
00:26:19,560 --> 00:26:20,040
Right.

418
00:26:21,910 --> 00:26:23,040
Doctor Su will be

419
00:26:23,650 --> 00:26:25,780
at the palace within an hour
for my follow-up.

420
00:26:25,780 --> 00:26:27,440
Go to the gate and receive her.

421
00:26:27,720 --> 00:26:28,330
Yes.

422
00:26:36,000 --> 00:26:36,930
Dr. Su.

423
00:26:37,300 --> 00:26:38,150
Sorry to keep you waiting.

424
00:26:38,150 --> 00:26:39,280
I'm finally done.

425
00:26:40,000 --> 00:26:40,560
Come on.

426
00:26:41,960 --> 00:26:42,690
No need.

427
00:26:43,870 --> 00:26:44,420
What

428
00:26:45,480 --> 00:26:46,460
does this mean?

429
00:26:46,500 --> 00:26:47,930
The ointment needs to be applied

430
00:26:46,710 --> 00:26:50,530
[Doctor Su Jingxi]

431
00:26:48,760 --> 00:26:50,420
three times a day on schedule.

432
00:26:50,690 --> 00:26:51,980
Have you been doing it properly?

433
00:26:51,980 --> 00:26:53,560
I just forgot a few times.

434
00:26:53,850 --> 00:26:56,240
Why are you so upset?

435
00:26:57,330 --> 00:26:58,740
I'll apply it right now.

436
00:27:02,350 --> 00:27:03,330
It's too late.

437
00:27:04,340 --> 00:27:05,940
This is a disease of the mind.

438
00:27:08,310 --> 00:27:10,170
I don't have a disease of the mind.

439
00:27:13,330 --> 00:27:14,240
Eunuch Zhu.

440
00:27:14,480 --> 00:27:16,740
I just want to find the root cause
for you.

441
00:27:17,110 --> 00:27:19,090
This condition is only 30%
about the medicine.

442
00:27:19,090 --> 00:27:20,170
Recovery is key.

443
00:27:26,020 --> 00:27:27,410
After tonight,

444
00:27:29,740 --> 00:27:32,000
everything will be settled.

445
00:27:32,370 --> 00:27:33,430
That would be best.

446
00:27:35,650 --> 00:27:36,710
I'll take my leave.

447
00:27:39,450 --> 00:27:40,280
Dr. Su,

448
00:27:40,740 --> 00:27:41,470
please wait.

449
00:27:47,650 --> 00:27:49,200
I have one more request.

450
00:27:49,960 --> 00:27:50,930
Please speak.

451
00:27:51,720 --> 00:27:53,180
You must promise me first.

452
00:27:54,930 --> 00:27:56,370
What do you mean?

453
00:27:56,780 --> 00:27:58,510
I will be going to Beijing soon.

454
00:27:58,850 --> 00:27:59,760
Dr. Su,

455
00:28:00,720 --> 00:28:02,850
would you like to go to Beijing with me?

456
00:28:03,720 --> 00:28:04,280
Alright.

457
00:28:04,980 --> 00:28:06,130
I will go with you.

458
00:28:22,240 --> 00:28:25,850
[Beijing Imperial City]

459
00:28:26,190 --> 00:28:27,650
Has His Majesty awakened?

460
00:28:27,690 --> 00:28:28,280
No.

461
00:28:28,670 --> 00:28:30,600
Move a set of His Majesty's bedding

462
00:28:30,940 --> 00:28:32,670
and belongings to Qin'an Hall.

463
00:28:33,870 --> 00:28:35,240
I'll stay by his side day and night.

464
00:28:35,160 --> 00:28:38,470
[Empress, Zhang] [Hai Shou, Vice Director
of the Directorate of the Imperial Stables]

465
00:28:36,260 --> 00:28:37,670
It'll put my mind at ease.

466
00:28:37,760 --> 00:28:38,410
Yes.

467
00:28:47,850 --> 00:28:48,610
Lord Lyu,

468
00:28:49,200 --> 00:28:49,960
rise.

469
00:28:50,590 --> 00:28:51,990
Thank you, Your Majesty.

470
00:28:54,260 --> 00:28:56,750
[Vice Minister of Rites, Lord Lyu]

471
00:28:55,370 --> 00:28:56,910
I received your decree ordering

472
00:28:56,910 --> 00:29:00,170
the heads of all government offices
in the capital to enter the palace

473
00:29:00,170 --> 00:29:01,760
and summoning all vassal kings

474
00:29:01,760 --> 00:29:03,080
to the capital at once.

475
00:29:04,780 --> 00:29:05,960
I don't understand.

476
00:29:08,410 --> 00:29:09,560
His Majesty is ill,

477
00:29:10,000 --> 00:29:12,370
and the Crown Prince is far away.

478
00:29:13,150 --> 00:29:14,520
The safest course

479
00:29:14,800 --> 00:29:16,590
is to keep anyone with ulterior motives

480
00:29:16,590 --> 00:29:19,510
within my sight.

481
00:29:20,670 --> 00:29:22,170
In Your Majesty's eyes,

482
00:29:23,480 --> 00:29:25,520
who exactly has ulterior motives?

483
00:29:29,240 --> 00:29:31,150
I have my own reasons.

484
00:29:31,690 --> 00:29:32,490
Your Majesty,

485
00:29:32,980 --> 00:29:35,870
summoning all the vassal kings
to the capital so conspicuously

486
00:29:35,870 --> 00:29:37,670
at such a time
is tantamount to announcing

487
00:29:37,670 --> 00:29:39,720
to the realm that His Majesty
is gravely ill.

488
00:29:39,720 --> 00:29:40,520
Your Majesty,

489
00:29:40,670 --> 00:29:42,470
I urge you to think this through.

490
00:29:46,270 --> 00:29:47,900
His Majesty is ill,

491
00:29:48,280 --> 00:29:50,080
and the Crown Prince is far away.

492
00:29:50,110 --> 00:29:52,090
Extraordinary times call
for extraordinary measures.

493
00:29:52,090 --> 00:29:53,590
We'll decide what comes next

494
00:29:53,590 --> 00:29:55,050
as circumstances unfold.

495
00:29:56,120 --> 00:29:56,930
Lord Lyu.

496
00:29:59,260 --> 00:30:00,920
I take my leave, Your Majesty.

497
00:30:21,690 --> 00:30:22,890
What about Yuan Zhongda?

498
00:30:22,890 --> 00:30:23,650
Has the bamboo message tube
for the Crown Prince

499
00:30:23,650 --> 00:30:25,000
been delivered to him?

500
00:30:25,170 --> 00:30:26,040
Your Majesty,

501
00:30:26,230 --> 00:30:28,310
it's over 2000 miles
from Beijing to Jinling.

502
00:30:28,310 --> 00:30:30,510
Sent by express courier
at 600 lis a day,

503
00:30:31,030 --> 00:30:33,690
it should arrive
within the next couple of days.

504
00:30:34,190 --> 00:30:35,960
Lord Yuan has arrived.

505
00:30:38,410 --> 00:30:39,740
Bring the chess pieces.

506
00:30:45,100 --> 00:30:48,740
[Chief Minister, Yuan Zhongda]

507
00:30:49,700 --> 00:30:53,130
I just received

508
00:30:53,280 --> 00:30:54,690
an urgent dispatch

509
00:30:54,960 --> 00:30:56,290
from the capital today.

510
00:31:00,700 --> 00:31:02,000
An urgent dispatch?

511
00:31:02,910 --> 00:31:03,930
What is it about?

512
00:31:04,220 --> 00:31:06,350
It was sent by Her Majesty the Empress.

513
00:31:06,520 --> 00:31:07,320
She ordered me

514
00:31:07,520 --> 00:31:10,500
to hand this bamboo message tube
to Your Highness personally,

515
00:31:10,500 --> 00:31:11,410
and instructed

516
00:31:11,540 --> 00:31:12,930
that Your Highness must

517
00:31:16,100 --> 00:31:17,130
read it alone.

518
00:31:26,560 --> 00:31:27,800
Help the sir up.

519
00:31:28,500 --> 00:31:29,960
Thank you, Your Highness.

520
00:31:30,720 --> 00:31:31,480
Leave us.

521
00:32:08,050 --> 00:32:12,180
[On the gengchen day of the fifth month,
the Emperor fell ill.]

522
00:32:12,180 --> 00:32:16,320
[The Crown Prince should return
to the capital immediately.]

523
00:32:31,580 --> 00:32:34,710
My mother wants me
to return to the capital immediately.

524
00:32:38,090 --> 00:32:40,350
Jinling is over 2000 miles from Beijing.

525
00:32:41,190 --> 00:32:42,850
How can I return immediately?

526
00:32:46,740 --> 00:32:47,650
Your Highness.

527
00:32:51,720 --> 00:32:54,980
If it means Your Highness can return
to the capital as soon as possible,

528
00:32:54,980 --> 00:32:58,310
I am willing to offer
my humble assistance.

529
00:33:13,760 --> 00:33:15,890
My body really can't take it anymore.

530
00:33:15,930 --> 00:33:16,720
Yes.

531
00:33:29,130 --> 00:33:30,860
Let me go first. Let me go first.

532
00:33:41,280 --> 00:33:42,090
Wait a moment.

533
00:34:14,080 --> 00:34:17,139
The Prince of Jin, the Prince of Dai,
and the Prince of Lu

534
00:34:17,290 --> 00:34:20,949
have arrived by imperial summons
to await Your Majesty's decree.

535
00:34:33,060 --> 00:34:33,860
Your Majesty.

536
00:34:34,810 --> 00:34:36,230
The Three Dukes and Three Solitaries
in the capital,

537
00:34:36,230 --> 00:34:37,210
the Ministers of the Six Ministries,

538
00:34:37,210 --> 00:34:39,580
the Vice Ministers, the Censors-in-Chief
of the Censorate,

539
00:34:39,580 --> 00:34:41,179
and the vassal kings
from neighboring provinces

540
00:34:41,179 --> 00:34:42,179
have all arrived.

541
00:34:44,020 --> 00:34:45,280
What about Prince Han?

542
00:34:46,290 --> 00:34:48,290
How far is Le'an Prefecture from Beijing?

543
00:34:48,290 --> 00:34:49,750
Why hasn't he arrived yet?

544
00:34:50,179 --> 00:34:51,159
Go and urge him.

545
00:34:51,679 --> 00:34:52,810
Within 3 days,

546
00:34:53,139 --> 00:34:55,010
he must stay here in Qin'an Hall.

547
00:34:55,710 --> 00:34:56,389
Yes.

548
00:34:56,870 --> 00:34:59,150
His Highness Prince Han
has arrived on summons,

549
00:34:59,150 --> 00:35:01,880
awaiting the imperial decree.

550
00:35:01,910 --> 00:35:02,520
Go.

551
00:35:40,240 --> 00:35:42,240
[South Warden's Office]

552
00:35:42,550 --> 00:35:44,330
My Lord, our place is small.

553
00:35:44,450 --> 00:35:45,870
We usually just follow orders.

554
00:35:45,870 --> 00:35:47,560
You've brought so many prisoners
all at once.

555
00:35:47,560 --> 00:35:49,140
Since you know to follow orders,

556
00:35:49,140 --> 00:35:50,430
why don't you follow the orders
of the Eastern Palace?

557
00:35:50,430 --> 00:35:51,200
We will, we will.

558
00:35:51,200 --> 00:35:52,300
I hold this token.

559
00:35:52,500 --> 00:35:54,250
How dare the Warden's Office
not recognize it?

560
00:35:54,250 --> 00:35:55,290
We do, we do.

561
00:35:55,330 --> 00:35:56,350
Interrogating key criminals

562
00:35:56,350 --> 00:35:57,120
and guarding the Imperial City

563
00:35:57,120 --> 00:35:58,560
are your duties.

564
00:35:58,750 --> 00:36:00,750
Do you expect me to handle it myself?

565
00:36:01,250 --> 00:36:03,080
I-I didn't say we wouldn't follow orders.

566
00:36:03,080 --> 00:36:05,010
Keep a close watch on these people.

567
00:36:06,790 --> 00:36:08,040
I will interrogate them

568
00:36:08,040 --> 00:36:08,970
one by one later.

569
00:36:09,180 --> 00:36:10,110
Little Xingren!

570
00:36:12,600 --> 00:36:13,250
Little Xingren!

571
00:36:13,250 --> 00:36:14,000
You guys,

572
00:36:14,290 --> 00:36:15,090
sit properly.

573
00:36:15,330 --> 00:36:16,480
Good-for-Nothing, I'm in trouble.

574
00:36:16,480 --> 00:36:17,560
Save me. Hurry!

575
00:36:17,580 --> 00:36:18,840
Wait, why are you here?

576
00:36:18,880 --> 00:36:21,450
[Bailonggua, Long Si]

577
00:36:19,010 --> 00:36:19,640
I was just watching the fun

578
00:36:19,640 --> 00:36:20,390
and didn't run in time.

579
00:36:20,390 --> 00:36:21,980
They pinned me to the ground.

580
00:36:21,980 --> 00:36:22,520
Guys,

581
00:36:23,120 --> 00:36:24,720
you've got the wrong person.

582
00:36:24,860 --> 00:36:26,320
Aren't you after the Iron Alliance?

583
00:36:26,320 --> 00:36:26,820
Look,

584
00:36:27,250 --> 00:36:28,330
members of the Iron Alliance

585
00:36:28,330 --> 00:36:29,830
have blades under their boots.

586
00:36:29,830 --> 00:36:31,470
Look at what he's wearing.

587
00:36:31,850 --> 00:36:32,560
Hemp shoes.

588
00:36:32,870 --> 00:36:34,060
You've got the wrong person.

589
00:36:34,060 --> 00:36:34,710
Let him go.

590
00:36:35,020 --> 00:36:36,150
Pin him down!

591
00:36:38,320 --> 00:36:38,950
Step back.

592
00:36:39,600 --> 00:36:41,580
Let's see who dares to touch him today.

593
00:36:41,580 --> 00:36:42,310
Wu Dingyuan,

594
00:36:42,440 --> 00:36:43,640
stop messing around.

595
00:36:43,840 --> 00:36:45,660
They are all wanted criminals
of the court.

596
00:36:45,660 --> 00:36:46,790
If you're so capable,

597
00:36:46,790 --> 00:36:48,410
why don't you deal with the Iron Alliance

598
00:36:48,410 --> 00:36:50,060
instead of biting me back?

599
00:36:50,330 --> 00:36:52,180
Of course I will arrest
the Iron Alliance people.

600
00:36:52,180 --> 00:36:53,380
But you took the money

601
00:36:53,580 --> 00:36:55,230
and didn't guard the door
of Xinghua Restaurant.

602
00:36:55,230 --> 00:36:56,370
You are dishonest!

603
00:36:56,660 --> 00:36:57,330
Yes,

604
00:36:57,700 --> 00:36:59,240
I did take the money,

605
00:36:59,540 --> 00:37:01,060
but I'm not selling my life.

606
00:37:01,060 --> 00:37:01,960
Look for yourself.

607
00:37:01,960 --> 00:37:03,440
You made such a big scene,

608
00:37:03,640 --> 00:37:04,810
brought so many soldiers,

609
00:37:04,810 --> 00:37:05,870
and hacked at everyone you saw.

610
00:37:05,870 --> 00:37:06,960
How could I not run?

611
00:37:09,210 --> 00:37:10,890
Okay, let me ask you.

612
00:37:11,160 --> 00:37:12,520
Outside Xinghua Restaurant,

613
00:37:12,520 --> 00:37:14,120
there was a carriage parked.

614
00:37:14,120 --> 00:37:15,080
Did you see it?

615
00:37:17,100 --> 00:37:18,030
Little Xingren,

616
00:37:18,600 --> 00:37:20,210
watch your tone.

617
00:37:20,810 --> 00:37:21,940
Who do you think I am?

618
00:37:22,100 --> 00:37:23,190
Are you interrogating a prisoner?

619
00:37:23,190 --> 00:37:24,460
-Why are you arresting me?
-Behave!

620
00:37:24,460 --> 00:37:25,250
What did I do?

621
00:37:25,390 --> 00:37:26,640
These Iron Alliance people

622
00:37:26,640 --> 00:37:28,500
never tell a single word of truth.

623
00:37:29,020 --> 00:37:29,680
Squat down!

624
00:37:29,770 --> 00:37:31,080
If you don't listen, you'll be beaten!

625
00:37:31,080 --> 00:37:31,960
Did you hear me?

626
00:37:32,230 --> 00:37:33,660
Previously, when my father and I

627
00:37:33,660 --> 00:37:36,870
were investigating the case of the missing
Huliu explosive in the palace,

628
00:37:36,870 --> 00:37:38,470
we were just about to find out

629
00:37:39,000 --> 00:37:40,660
that the one smuggling the Huliu explosive

630
00:37:40,660 --> 00:37:43,030
was highly likely to be Lord Guo Zhimin.

631
00:37:43,730 --> 00:37:45,530
But when we arrived at his house,

632
00:37:45,690 --> 00:37:47,350
he had already been silenced.

633
00:37:47,710 --> 00:37:48,970
So the trail went cold.

634
00:37:50,710 --> 00:37:51,770
Not exactly.

635
00:37:52,830 --> 00:37:54,690
I found this at the Guo residence.

636
00:37:56,800 --> 00:37:58,530
[Puji Clinic]

637
00:37:58,360 --> 00:37:59,890
We can start investigating

638
00:37:59,890 --> 00:38:01,890
by looking into this prescription.

639
00:38:03,460 --> 00:38:04,810
[Su Jingxi]

640
00:38:08,250 --> 00:38:09,180
Little Xingren.

641
00:38:09,750 --> 00:38:10,480
Look.

642
00:38:10,770 --> 00:38:13,830
Members of the Iron Alliance
have gathered in Jinling.

643
00:38:14,230 --> 00:38:16,390
They will definitely make their next move.

644
00:38:16,390 --> 00:38:17,600
The most urgent thing now

645
00:38:17,600 --> 00:38:19,600
is to act before they do.

646
00:38:20,100 --> 00:38:21,360
How does the saying go?

647
00:38:21,640 --> 00:38:23,500
To catch the bandits,
first catch the ringleader.

648
00:38:23,500 --> 00:38:27,300
Catch the real culprit who blew up
the Crown Prince's treasure ship.

649
00:38:27,910 --> 00:38:28,840
That way, you'll

650
00:38:28,910 --> 00:38:30,330
earn favor and rewards

651
00:38:30,540 --> 00:38:31,620
from the Crown Prince,

652
00:38:31,620 --> 00:38:32,190
right?

653
00:38:32,710 --> 00:38:34,240
I'm not asking for a reward!

654
00:38:34,950 --> 00:38:36,310
I ask that anyone who acts against
His Highness the Crown Prince

655
00:38:36,310 --> 00:38:38,250
and commits such a heinous crime

656
00:38:38,620 --> 00:38:40,040
be condemned by the whole world!

657
00:38:40,040 --> 00:38:40,750
All right, all right.

658
00:38:40,750 --> 00:38:41,580
Save it.

659
00:38:41,830 --> 00:38:42,890
Don't give me that.

660
00:38:54,260 --> 00:38:56,870
[Puji Clinic]

661
00:38:56,010 --> 00:38:57,430
Are you sure this is the place?

662
00:38:57,430 --> 00:38:58,360
Little Xingren.

663
00:38:58,960 --> 00:39:00,290
Can't you read, either?

664
00:39:01,660 --> 00:39:02,480
I mean,

665
00:39:02,480 --> 00:39:04,210
is this the only Puji Clinic?

666
00:39:04,580 --> 00:39:06,140
Are there no other branches?

667
00:39:06,140 --> 00:39:07,740
If there are other branches,

668
00:39:07,750 --> 00:39:09,610
are we not going to check this one?

669
00:39:15,600 --> 00:39:16,450
Constable Wu.

670
00:39:17,370 --> 00:39:19,120
You don't have a problem
picking locks, do you?

671
00:39:19,120 --> 00:39:20,310
I've actually come across

672
00:39:20,310 --> 00:39:21,480
a lock I can't pick.

673
00:39:22,060 --> 00:39:22,670
Look.

674
00:39:23,240 --> 00:39:25,040
This doctor is very meticulous.

675
00:39:26,000 --> 00:39:28,200
They filled the lock cylinder with wax.

676
00:39:30,890 --> 00:39:33,610
♪ Call me crazy, call me a coward ♪

677
00:39:33,630 --> 00:39:35,020
♪ The Qinhuai River breeds fools like me ♪

678
00:39:36,430 --> 00:39:39,260
♪ A knife tucked at my waist,
wine burning in my throat ♪

679
00:39:39,290 --> 00:39:40,990
♪ Both feet planted in the mud ♪

680
00:39:42,060 --> 00:39:44,900
♪ I brave the wind, I hit the ground ♪

681
00:39:44,930 --> 00:39:46,610
♪ I take the blows head-on,
never crying out in pain ♪

682
00:39:47,790 --> 00:39:50,830
♪ My life hangs by a thread,
my worries buried in my bones ♪

683
00:39:50,850 --> 00:39:52,850
♪ Whatever I owe, I'll repay in time ♪

684
00:39:50,890 --> 00:39:53,090
Good-for-Nothing, don't mess around.

685
00:39:53,300 --> 00:39:54,650
♪ Swaying along, swaying along ♪

686
00:39:54,670 --> 00:39:55,960
♪ Swaying along, swaying along ♪

687
00:39:55,990 --> 00:39:57,490
♪ Swaying along—
what's all the swaying for? ♪

688
00:39:58,740 --> 00:39:59,980
♪ Chasing them down, chasing them down ♪

689
00:40:00,120 --> 00:40:01,360
♪ Chasing them down, chasing them down ♪

690
00:40:01,380 --> 00:40:03,610
♪ Chasing them down—
what am I chasing for? ♪

691
00:40:02,750 --> 00:40:04,200
With those feeble skills of yours,

692
00:40:04,200 --> 00:40:05,790
♪ Who knows? Who cares about me? ♪

693
00:40:04,850 --> 00:40:06,120
you think you can take care
of the Crown Prince?

694
00:40:05,810 --> 00:40:07,220
♪ Who knows? Who cares about me? ♪

695
00:40:07,330 --> 00:40:09,030
♪ Who knows where home is? ♪

696
00:40:09,850 --> 00:40:11,300
♪ To hell with princes and nobles ♪

697
00:40:11,340 --> 00:40:12,730
♪ To hell with
what the history books say ♪

698
00:40:12,750 --> 00:40:14,970
♪ I'm my own guardian angel ♪

699
00:41:15,990 --> 00:41:16,700
Watch out!

700
00:41:22,980 --> 00:41:23,520
Sit down.

701
00:41:23,700 --> 00:41:24,280
Sit down.

702
00:41:24,860 --> 00:41:25,630
Sit down.

703
00:41:26,260 --> 00:41:27,390
Good-for-Nothing.

704
00:41:27,480 --> 00:41:28,290
After all, she's a...

705
00:41:28,290 --> 00:41:29,040
Woman.

706
00:41:30,550 --> 00:41:32,480
We constables, do things differently.

707
00:41:32,480 --> 00:41:34,080
We don't have those rules
you scholars have

708
00:41:34,080 --> 00:41:35,930
about men and women not touching.

709
00:41:35,930 --> 00:41:36,970
You broke into someone's home

710
00:41:36,970 --> 00:41:38,480
and tied people up for no reason.

711
00:41:38,480 --> 00:41:40,060
Do you really think there's
no law in Jinling?

712
00:41:40,060 --> 00:41:40,870
Behave!

713
00:41:52,640 --> 00:41:54,100
What's your relationship

714
00:41:54,560 --> 00:41:55,760
with Lord Guo Zhimin?

715
00:42:00,330 --> 00:42:01,770
I found a prescription

716
00:42:01,820 --> 00:42:02,990
on the table in the Guo residence

717
00:42:02,990 --> 00:42:04,340
that you wrote for him.

718
00:42:10,050 --> 00:42:11,390
I'm his fiancée.

719
00:42:11,960 --> 00:42:13,490
He was restless a while ago,

720
00:42:14,180 --> 00:42:16,380
so I prescribed him something to sleep.

721
00:42:16,540 --> 00:42:17,600
He's already dead.

722
00:42:17,660 --> 00:42:18,410
Did you know?

723
00:42:18,840 --> 00:42:19,380
Yes.

724
00:42:19,640 --> 00:42:20,440
How did he die?

725
00:42:21,560 --> 00:42:22,850
You wouldn't think I killed him

726
00:42:22,850 --> 00:42:25,110
just based on a prescription, would you?

727
00:42:26,290 --> 00:42:27,090
Let me ask you.

728
00:42:28,000 --> 00:42:29,410
What's your relationship
with the Iron Alliance?

729
00:42:29,410 --> 00:42:30,210
What?

730
00:42:30,560 --> 00:42:32,080
-Little Xingren.
-Iron Alliance!

731
00:42:32,080 --> 00:42:34,520
You can't talk to a beauty like that.

732
00:42:36,100 --> 00:42:38,640
My name is Su Jingxi, from Yangzhou.

733
00:42:39,330 --> 00:42:42,000
I'm from the third branch
of the Su family in Wanfuqiao.

734
00:42:42,000 --> 00:42:43,600
My family has practiced medicine
for generations.

735
00:42:43,600 --> 00:42:45,290
I'm not from the Iron Alliance.

736
00:42:45,290 --> 00:42:45,810
You...

737
00:42:48,930 --> 00:42:49,500
What are you doing?

738
00:42:49,500 --> 00:42:50,410
Behave!

739
00:42:52,500 --> 00:42:53,210
Don't move.

740
00:42:59,370 --> 00:43:01,120
A token from the Directorate
of the Imperial Stables

741
00:43:01,120 --> 00:43:03,380
used to enter and exit the Imperial City.

742
00:43:05,210 --> 00:43:06,930
How do you have Eunuch Zhu's token?
